name: sum_3_or_5
ret: int
kind: loop
sig: fn sum_3_or_5(n: int) -> [] int
desc: The sum of all numbers from 1 to n (n included) that are divisible by 3 or by 5. sum_3_or_5(10) is 23 (3+5+6+9+10). Domain: 0 <= n <= 1000.
example: sum_3_or_5(10) == 23
example: sum_3_or_5(0) == 0
example: sum_3_or_5(5) == 14
